# Keep secrets, dependencies, build output and tests out of the build context (R-02).
# Patterns without **/ only match the repo root, so anything that can also sit in client/ or server/ uses **/.
.git
.github
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
e2e
docs
**/*.md
**/.DS_Store
**/.vscode
**/.idea
